# A security key for omorfos-lock, such as a YubiKey, touched, asked at the
# same time as the password. Any one of the ways unlocks; turn this one off
# with `lock.key: false` in config.yaml, or leave it without pam_u2f, and
# it is not offered. A key that asks for its PIN goes in `omorfos-lock`.
auth required pam_u2f.so cue
